WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:03.139
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:06.039
What do they see?

3
00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:11.439
They see farm animals in pens.

4
00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:17.377
The blobs run to the pens.

5
00:00:17.378 --> 00:00:38.982
They pet the chickens.

6
00:00:38.983 --> 00:00:58.101
They pet the pigs.

7
00:00:58.102 --> 00:01:20.436
They pet the sheep.

8
00:01:20.437 --> 00:01:31.784
They pet the goats.

9
00:01:31.785 --> 00:01:50.682
They pet the donkeys.

10
00:01:50.683 --> 00:01:55.908
The blobs leave the pens.

11
00:01:55.909 --> 00:02:03.383
Oh! They see another animal!

12
00:02:03.384 --> 00:02:09.515
Silly blobs, don't pet the skunk!

13
00:02:09.516 --> 00:02:13.869
Oh no.

14
00:02:13.870 --> 00:02:16.531
Smelly blobs!

15
00:02:16.532 --> 00:02:19.985
Good-bye!

